1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:01,295
Search in the Deck.

2
00:00:01,335 --> 00:00:03,560
Apps, contacts, sums and
the web, as you type.

3
00:00:04,300 --> 00:00:05,844
Open the Deck, tap Search.

4
00:00:05,884 --> 00:00:08,219
Swipe in from the tab, then tap Search.

5
00:00:08,259 --> 00:00:10,960
The keyboard comes up,
ready for you to type.

6
00:00:11,300 --> 00:00:12,504
Work out a sum.

7
00:00:12,544 --> 00:00:16,320
Type a sum and the answer
appears as you type.

8
00:00:16,360 --> 00:00:18,560
Tap Copy result to copy it.

9
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:19,843
Find an app.

10
00:00:19,883 --> 00:00:23,367
Type part of an app’s
name and it shows up.

11
00:00:23,407 --> 00:00:24,760
One tap opens it.

12
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,185
Find a contact.

13
00:00:26,225 --> 00:00:30,760
Your quick-dial people show up
too, ready to call or message.

14
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:32,263
Call a number.

15
00:00:32,303 --> 00:00:37,160
Type a phone number and one
tap opens the dialer with it.

16
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:38,446
Search the web.

17
00:00:38,486 --> 00:00:40,419
Anything else goes to the web.

18
00:00:40,459 --> 00:00:44,760
Pick a provider, or press Search
on the keyboard for your default.

19
00:00:45,100 --> 00:00:45,576
Close it.

20
00:00:45,616 --> 00:00:47,639
Tap anywhere outside, or press Back.

21
00:00:47,679 --> 00:00:50,160
The Deck slides away
and the tab comes back.

22
00:00:51,050 --> 00:00:55,510
Up next: The long-press menu.
